/*
  Localizable.strings (English)
  Cybokron Dock Groups

  The English text of every key. Translations go in Resources/<language>.lproj/Localizable.strings
  with exactly the same keys (sections marked "English only for now" may still be missing there; the
  app then shows the English text). Keep the placeholders: %@ is text, %ld a number, and %1$@, %2$ld …
  are numbered so a translation can put them in another order. Keys ending in .one/.other are
  the singular (count 1) and the plural text of a count. The app name "Cybokron Dock Groups",
  "DockGroups", "GitHub", "Siri", key symbols (⌘ ⌥ ⇧ ⌃ ↩ ⌫ esc) and file names stay as they are.
  The texts are also in Sources (L10n.swift and DockGroupsCore); LocalizationTests keep them equal.
*/

